h monsters and hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover powerful essences that grant spells and abilities, making every run feel different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat powerful bosses to discover legendary essences.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/7ae065074ae19c2af37e879afc2ef98c.avif?t=1770570482\" width=\"1000\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/1c87c4965992f5d48037723fd51cd31e.poster.avif?t=1770570482\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/1c87c4965992f5d48037723fd51cd31e.webm?t=1770570482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/1c87c4965992f5d48037723fd51cd31e.mp4?t=1770570482\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the game as teams of 1, 2 or 3 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expedition difficulty and rewards dynamically adapt to your team size</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/0e8b6c6141d712f5500b58f34425b335.avif?t=1770570482\" width=\"1000\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/18cc1bb28805bfb689e3d10f21ad5947.poster.avif?t=1770570482\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"